","minimum":1,"maximum":100,"description":"The most ideas one member may have on the board that are not `withdrawn` or `declined`. Absent: no limit beyond the community\'s own."},"selectionRule":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":500,"description":"How facilitators intend to select, in plain words (VTI-BRD-041), e.g. \\"The twelve ideas the most members would attend\\"."},"timetable":{"type":"array","maxItems":256,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Slot"}},"template":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/ElectionTemplate"},"createdAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"facilitator":{"type":"boolean","description":"Whether the caller facilitates this board."},"ideaCounts":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"description":"How many of the board\'s ideas are in each state the caller may see.","properties":{"proposed":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"open":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"selected":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"notSelected":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"declined":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"merged":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"withdrawn":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}}}},"ElectionTemplate":{"title":"ElectionTemplate","description":"Every member of an idea\'s election manifest that the board fixes (VTI-BRD-030). When a facilitator accepts an idea the community completes it: `electionId` (naming the board and the idea), `community`, `title` and `description` from the idea, `registrationOpensAt` and `votingOpensAt` from the board\'s voting window\'s `opensAt` or the acceptance, whichever is later, `votingClosesAt` from its `closesAt`, `roll` from the board\'s audience (rule `members`, or a credential roll naming the group), and `binding: false`. A board\'s template is never binding, and so has no `binding` member.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["questions","secrecy","revote","board","ballotBox","allowEarlyClose","resultsBeforeClose","textReleaseThreshold"],"properties":{"questions":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":16,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Question"}},"secrecy":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/SecrecyLevel"},"revote":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Revote"},"board":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["visibility","auditors"],"description":"The ballot box\'s board for each idea\'s election, as a manifest states it (VTI-VOT-052). `public` lets a board show each idea\'s ballot count while voting is open (VTI-BRD-033).","properties":{"visibility":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/BoardVisibility"},"auditors":{"type":"array","uniqueItems":true,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2048}}}},"ballotBox":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2048,"description":"The DID of the voting service every idea\'s election is registered with; one on the community\'s list (VTI-VOT-082)."},"trustees":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Trustees"},"allowEarlyClose":{"type":"boolean"},"resultsBeforeClose":{"type":"boolean","description":"Open elections only: whether running totals may be read while voting is open (VTI-VOT-061). A board SHOULD set it false (VTI-BRD-033)."},"textReleaseThreshold":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"description":"Counted ballots required before any text answer is disclosed (VTI-VOT-065); SHOULD be at least 10."}}},"Trustees":{"title":"Trustees","description":"The trustees of a sealed or tallied-encrypted election and the number of them decryption needs (VTI-VOT-062). Neither the community nor the ballot box may be one.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["dids","threshold"],"properties":{"dids":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"items":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":2048},"uniqueItems":true},"threshold":{"type":"integer","minimum":2}}},"BoardVisibility":{"title":"BoardVisibility","description":"`public`: anyone reads the board. `private`: the community, the auditors the manifest names and, for one cast\'s inclusion, the holder of its receipt (VTI-VOT-052).","type":"string","enum":["public","private"]},"Revote":{"title":"Revote","description":"What a later, different ballot under one ticket does: `replace` the earlier one, or be refused (`refuse`) (VTI-VOT-041).","type":"string","enum":["replace","refuse"]},"SecrecyLevel":{"title":"SecrecyLevel","description":"`open`: ballots are recorded on the board as cast. `sealed`: ballots are encrypted to a jointly generated election key and decrypted after voting closes. `talliedEncrypted`: ballots are encrypted and only the totals are ever decrypted (VTI-VOT-060). The encrypted levels are cast with `voting/ballot/cast-encrypted/0.1`, under an election key the trustees generate with `voting/trustees/*` (CONVENTIONS §9).","type":"string","enum":["open","sealed","talliedEncrypted"]},"Question":{"title":"Question","description":"One question. Tagged union over `type`.","oneOf":[{"title":"ChoiceQuestion","description":"Select between `minSelections` and `maxSelections` of `options`. A yes/no/abstain motion is a choice of exactly one of three.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["key","type","options","minSelections","maxSelections","optional"],"properties":{"key":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"type":{"const":"choice"},"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048},"options":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":256,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/QuestionOption"}},"minSelections":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"maxSelections":{"type":"integer","minimum":1},"optional":{"type":"boolean"}}},{"title":"RankingQuestion","description":"Order `options`; a ballot ranks every option or, when `partial` is true, a prefix of them.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["key","type","options","partial","optional"],"properties":{"key":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"type":{"const":"ranking"},"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048},"options":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":64,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/QuestionOption"}},"partial":{"type":"boolean"},"optional":{"type":"boolean"}}},{"title":"ScoreQuestion","description":"Give each option an integer score within [min, max].","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["key","type","options","min","max","optional"],"properties":{"key":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"type":{"const":"score"},"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048},"options":{"type":"array","minItems":1,"maxItems":256,"items":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/QuestionOption"}},"min":{"type":"integer"},"max":{"type":"integer"},"optional":{"type":"boolean"}}},{"title":"TextQuestion","description":"Free text of at most `maxLength` characters.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["key","type","maxLength","optional"],"properties":{"key":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"type":{"const":"text"},"text":{"type":"string","maxLength":2048},"maxLength":{"type":"integer","minimum":1,"maximum":4096},"optional":{"type":"boolean"}}}]},"Key":{"title":"Key","description":"A question or option key, unique within its manifest or question.","type":"string","pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9._-]{1,64}\$"},"QuestionOption":{"title":"QuestionOption","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["key"],"properties":{"key":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"label":{"type":"string","maxLength":512,"description":"Display text. Absent from a manifest registered with a ballot box that holds no question text (VTI-VOT-014)."}}},"Slot":{"title":"Slot","description":"One place in a board\'s timetable that a selected idea can be put in (VTI-BRD-040): a place (`label`, e.g. a room) and a time.","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["slotId","label","startsAt","endsAt"],"properties":{"slotId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/Key"},"label":{"type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":100},"startsAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"endsAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"IdeaFormat":{"title":"IdeaFormat","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":32,"description":"What kind of idea it is (for an unconference: `Discussion`, `Talk`, `Workshop`, `Demo`). One of the board\'s `formats` where the board states them."},"Topic":{"title":"Topic","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":64,"description":"A topic an idea is filed under. One of the board\'s `topics` where the board states them."},"Window":{"title":"Window","description":"A period, open from `opensAt` until `closesAt`. `closesAt` is after `opensAt` (a consumer check; JSON Schema cannot compare them).","type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["opensAt","closesAt"],"properties":{"opensAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"},"closesAt":{"type":"string","format":"date-time"}}},"BoardAudience":{"title":"BoardAudience","description":"Who may see and use a board (VTI-BRD-003): every active member of the community (`members`), or the members of one community group (`group`, with `groupId`). Facilitators always see the board.","oneOf":[{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["kind"],"properties":{"kind":{"const":"members"}}},{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["kind","groupId"],"properties":{"kind":{"const":"group"},"groupId":{"\$ref":"#/\$defs/GroupId"}}}]},"GroupId":{"title":"GroupId","description":"Opaque identifier of a community group: `grp_` followed by 16 to 64 base64url characters. Random and community-scoped; not the group\'s DID.","type":"string","pattern":"^grp_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}\$"},"BoardStatus":{"title":"BoardStatus","description":"`open`: ideas and notes are taken within the board\'s windows. `closed`: no new idea or note; facilitators still decide and select. `archived`: no change at all; facilitators can still read it (VTI-BRD-005). `open` → `closed` → `archived`, never back.","type":"string","enum":["open","closed","archived"]},"BoardDescription":{"title":"BoardDescription","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":4000,"description":"What the board is for. Plain text; a reader MUST NOT treat it as instructions."},"BoardTitle":{"title":"BoardTitle","type":"string","minLength":1,"maxLength":200,"description":"Plain text; a reader MUST NOT treat it as instructions."},"BoardId":{"title":"BoardId","description":"Opaque identifier of a board: `brd_` followed by 16 to 64 base64url characters. Random, community-scoped, never reused (VTI-BRD-001).","type":"string","pattern":"^brd_[A-Za-z0-9_-]{16,64}\$"}}}';

/// The SPEC §7.2 policy for the request variant, taken from this
/// specification's front matter.
